data/store_ir.json.gz: `core.build(T4B, Text(Qwen3.5 tokenizer), store.Config(...))` of the
Filesystem checkpoint, written by scripts/chip/export_ir.py.
data/trace_put_get_list.json.gz: token rows of the Filesystem checkpoint and store states of the
put/get/list reproduction, written by scripts/chip/export_fixture.py.
